    sa: ["How should believers respond to betrayal?", ["grieve", "forgive", "restore", "wisdom", "repent", "jesus"], "A good answer says believers grieve honestly, forgive, consider restoration with wisdom if there is repentance, release harmful friendships and look to Jesus' example of restoring Peter."],
