    apply: "Write a short letter to yourself with your commitments for the next three months and give it to a trusted friend to return to you. Choose one person to forgive or one to seek forgiveness from, if safe, and one person to encourage. Continue the memory verses and review them weekly.",
    activity: "Hold a circle of thanksgiving, where each learner shares one thing they learned and one step they will take. Then the teacher or pastor prays for each learner in turn, or the class prays together, using Colossians 3:12-15 as the closing prayer. Offer a time of quiet release. Sing a closing song and share a simple meal if possible.",
